I've left out the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/notifier@0.1.0`, so importing `http-client` would go beyond its authority. It would also send the digest's contents to an endpoint the graph never declared. If that enrichment is needed, the graph should grant it explicitly, for example with an `HTTPClient<['metadata.internal.example']>` capability on this node.

